Package: LASSORidge
Title: Variable Selection and Regularized Regression for Linear Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:c(
    person("Lilli", "Werwie", , "lilli.werwie@stud.uni-heidelberg.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Juliana", "Elwenn", , "juliana.elwenn@stud.uni-heidelberg.de", role = "aut"),
    person("Felix", "Preu", , "felix.preu@stud.uni-heidelberg.de", role = "aut"),
    person("Adina", "Göing", , "adina.goeing@stud.uni-heidelberg.de", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides methods for variable selection and regularized
    regression in linear models, including forward selection, backward
    selection, least angle regression (LAR), LASSO, and Ridge regression.
    The package also includes cross-validation tools for tuning parameter
    selection, as well as utilities for extracting, summarizing, and
    visualizing model results.
